skills/review-and-fix/scripts/review-and-fix.md:51:Orchestrator mode invokes `skills/review/scripts/review-core.sh` once with `--output-dir "$IMPLEMENT_TMPDIR/round-N"`, `--panel hard` (fixed internally — not a public `review-and-fix.sh` argv token), and `--dynamic-archetypes "$DYNAMIC_ARCHETYPES"`. `DYNAMIC_ARCHETYPES` is resolved in priority order: `--dynamic-archetypes` / `--no-dynamic-archetypes` CLI args > **non-empty** `LARCH_DYNAMIC_ARCHETYPES_MAX` in the process environment (an empty export is ignored so session-env can supply the cap) > `LARCH_DYNAMIC_ARCHETYPES_MAX` in session-env > `6` (default when `--implement-tmpdir` is set) > `0` (standalone default). On round 1 it captures `$IMPLEMENT_TMPDIR/pre-review-untracked.txt` via `scripts/snapshot-untracked.sh` so Step 6 can detect review-created untracked files, and writes `$IMPLEMENT_TMPDIR/pre-review-head.txt` (current HEAD SHA) so `check-review-changes.sh --head-baseline` can detect the per-round commits this script makes during Step 5. When `--run-id` is set, both pre-review snapshot files are also flushed to the `pre-review-untracked` and `pre-review-head` run-log batches under `$IMPLEMENT_TMPDIR/larch-logs`.
